text: >-
  September 10th: Charlie Kirk is assassinated. On that same day, Operation
  Bright Star (Cairo

  joint operation with the United States and France) formally ends.

  September 10th: BTT departs Provo, UT at 7:14am local time.

  September 11th: BTT departs Wilmington, DE for Cairo at 7:56am local time.

  September 13th: BND departs Provo at 12:57pm and goes to Goose Bay, Canada for
  fuel stop

  then continues on to Paris and then back to Cairo.

  September 18th: Erika gives an in-person interview with the New York Times at
  her and

  Charlie's condo.

  September 20th: Charlie's Catholic Funeral Mass held at St. Bernadette Church
  at 11am.

  September 21st: Charlie's public memorial event is held at State Farm Stadium.

  September 22nd: Charlie's friends (McCoys) and Erika Kirk have a private
  dinner and are in

  "joyous spirits" at Charlie's favorite restaurant.
